  "title": "IMS in 6G: From telephony foundation to intelligent communication platform",
  "summary": "<ul> <li>The IP Multimedia Subsystem (IMS) has been selected as the communication engine for 6G, ensuring continuity for telephony, emergency services and roaming across the next generation of mobile networks.</li> <li>Continuity is only one part of the story &ndash; with data channels, exposure APIs and AI integration, IMS is quickly evolving into a robust foundation for intelligent, real-time communication services.</li> </ul>",
